# Savvy Cart AI — always-on constraints

- Spec-driven ADLC: no feature code before an approved ticket + linted spec.
- Read `specs/constitution.md` and `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
- Google Cloud first (Vertex AI / Gemini, Cloud Run, managed data/auth/logging).
- Prototype deadline **18 Oct 2026** — prefer demoable MVP over breadth.
- Acceptance criteria must name verification (command, test, or assertion).
- Never invent prices/inventory/policy; surface AI uncertainty.
- No secrets in git; minimize PII; no payment-card data in logs.
